
# Comparative Analysis of Database Applications with AI

## Overview
Artificial Intelligence is transforming database management by enabling intelligent query optimization, predictive analytics, natural language querying, automated administration, and enhanced security.

This article compares traditional database systems with AI-powered database technologies, highlighting their architecture, applications, benefits, challenges, and future directions.

